<ul style="margin-top:12px"><li><strong>bussies jumps 6th → 2nd</strong> (14 → 20 pts).</li><li>Oasis, Harissa, AskOnce and Yantra each slip one place.</li><li><strong>Grand Finale top 15 does not change</strong>: the bonus only lands on a team already in the top 6.</li></ul></div>
